I would like to volunteer to be on the board or work on BPFK, wherever
I'd be most needed.  Here is my election speech (ahem).

I may not be the most fluent in Lojban, but I know 1,032 words, have
translated quite a bit, and have reached level 4 or 5 in Robin's
"vocabulary expertise stages." I have done podcasts, given public
presentations about Lojban, created an extensive website about Lojban,
and have hosted a local Lojban class in my home. I would like to
suggest to the voters that all of this is enough to make my
participation of more value than that of someone who used to speak
Lojban like a native, but is now inactive.

-epkat


